clause!(s27_1_c_1_1, "27.1", "Contract", r##"**Path search** applies when `path` contains no slash: `DT_RPATH`, `LD_LIBRARY_PATH`, `DT_RUNPATH`, `/etc/ld.so.cache`, then the default directories."##);
